      "line" : 18,
      "npc" : "Guild Clerk",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "The Emperium to be distributed to the guild office today has arrived. If you want to purchase, please put as many as you want~",
      "translation" : "今天要供應給公會辦事處的華麗金屬已經到貨了。想買的話，請按需要選擇數量～"
